@startuml
title ATM Control - Withdrawal Process

[*] --> Idle

state Idle
state WaitingForAmountSelection
state ValidatingWithdrawalAmount
state ConfirmingWithdrawal
state CancellingTransaction
state TerminatingTransaction

Idle : entry / Display Welcome
ClosedDown : entry / Display System Down

Idle --> WaitingForAmountSelection : Card Inserted / Get PIN

WaitingForAmountSelection --> ValidatingWithdrawalAmount : PIN Entered / Validate PIN
WaitingForAmountSelection --> Confiscating : Card Confiscated / display Confiscated
ValidatingWithdrawalAmount --> WaitingForAmountSelection : Invalid PIN / Invalid PIN Prompt

ValidatingWithdrawalAmount --> WaitingForAmountSelection : Stolen Card, Expired Card /\nConfiscate, Update Status
ValidatingWithdrawalAmount --> WaitingForAmountSelection : Third Invalid PIN /\nConfiscate

ValidatingWithdrawalAmount --> ConfirmingWithdrawal : Valid PIN / Display Menu

WaitingForAmountSelection --> CancellingTransaction : Cancel / Eject
ConfirmingWithdrawal --> CancellingTransaction : Cancel / Eject

ConfirmingWithdrawal --> TerminatingTransaction : Withdrawal Selected /\nRequest Withdrawal, Display Wait

TerminatingTransaction --> Idle : Rejected / Eject,\nDisplay Apology
TerminatingTransaction --> ClosedDown : Insufficient Cash /\nEject,\nAbort Cash Dispensed

@enduml
